   three_pointers_percentage \tab double \tab 3-point field goals percentage , 0-100 as a string with one decimal ('57.1'); '0.0' without attempts. \cr
   free_throws_percentage \tab double \tab Free throws percentage , 0-100 as a string with one decimal ('57.1'); '0.0' without attempts. \cr
   field_goals_percentage \tab double \tab Field goals percentage , 0-100 as a string with one decimal ('57.1'); '0.0' without attempts. \cr
   turnovers_percentage \tab double \tab Turnover percentage, 0-100 (a one-decimal string on the API; the exact formula is not documented). \cr
   efg \tab double \tab Effective field-goal percentage, 0-100 (the API's effective_field_goals_percentage, a one-decimal string). \cr
   tsp \tab double \tab True-shooting percentage, 0-100 (the API's true_shooting_percentage, a one-decimal string). \cr
}
}
\description{
A player's game log in one division: one row per game played, with that game's whole stat line.

Endpoint: \verb{GET https://api.tpbl.basketball/api/players/\{player_id\}/games/stats}
